            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩngũkwĩsũva ũtũkũlĩlye kwa Yeova; nũndũ Nevukatilesa mũsumbĩ wa Mbaviloni nũnũũkwatya kaũ naitũ: nokwĩthĩwa Yeova akatwĩka kwĩanana na mawĩa make onthe ma ũseng’ya, nĩ kana aende kuma kwitũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
